THIRD-PARTY LICENSES
====================

This file lists the licenses of third-party software that is bundled with, or
statically linked into, the distributed artifacts of @homaiohq/napi-quickfix.

The npm package ships prebuilt native binaries (`prebuilds/`) that statically
link the QuickFIX C++ FIX-protocol engine. QuickFIX itself is NOT vendored in
this source repository — it is fetched at build time from its upstream Git tag
via CMake FetchContent — but because its compiled code is embedded in the
published binaries, its license and the acknowledgement below are reproduced
here as required by that license.

